  "limitations": [
    "Planning only; no block registration or version/schema changes.",
    "Native multipart collision exists in target j_crossbrace_none.block.json. Project validator caps arrays at 16 boxes. Detailed per-course profiles can exceed 16; nativeCompact profiles satisfy the cap by conservatively enclosing each individual capital while retaining all four base courses.",
    "Profile counts are standalone collision-palette costs, not a proof of an absolute global minimum or visual tile identity costs; independent visual/material/editor properties can require more states.",
    "Single-box envelopes fill empty space beneath the tabletop and around supports; they do not satisfy the tight-collision requirement.",
    "Octagonal shafts use AABBs of the actual rendered shell vertices, including 0.02-unit skin. Inlays use their rotated AABBs. All other detailed boxes follow exact solid courses. Economical native additionally encloses all base courses and all three tabletop courses in one slab. Native compact and economical excess is measured as exact union-volume difference against the detailed envelope.",
    "Bounds are outward-rounded to 1e-6 units. Only exact duplicates and fully contained boxes are removed."
